THIRD-PARTY COMPONENTS

This software orchestrates but does not include the NCBI BLAST+ suite.
BLAST+ is produced by the National Center for Biotechnology Information and is
a United States Government Work in the public domain within the United States.
BLAST® is a registered trademark of the National Library of Medicine.
See https://blast.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/doc/blast-help/

Reference sequence data is obtained from NCBI RefSeq and NCBI Nucleotide and
remains subject to NCBI's data usage policies. Accessions, assembly identifiers
and checksums for every bundled database are recorded in docs/DATABASES.md.

Runtime dependencies are distributed under their own licences; see
package.json and the corresponding entries in node_modules.
